    "e": 9.36
   },
   {
    "text": "And it was only",
    "s": 9.36,
    "e": 10.28
   },
   {
    "text": "the beginning.",
    "s": 10.28,
    "e": 11.27
   }
  ],
  "s2": [
   {
    "text": "To understand why,",
    "s": 11.546,
    "e": 13.006
